  "status_note": "Transcribed on 18 November 2026 from the published figures of estimador-data scripts/licensing_report.py run on the Lisbon snapshot of 2 November 2026 (the report itself lives only on the Mac: ~/code/estimador-data-licensing/data/housing/licensing/reports/2026-11-02/lisboa_durations.json). Only the fields the housing page reads are kept: p50 and n by year of alvará for procedure 'licenca' (all operations) and for 'licenca' + 'construcao_nova', and the all-years quantiles. Replace this file with the report's own JSON (housing-page build --licensing-report) before anything is published.",
  "universe": {
    "lisbon": "Building processes under the RJUE at the Câmara Municipal de Lisboa that received an alvará, one per process (its first), counted by the year the alvará was issued. Procedure: licença. 'New build' is operation 'construção nova'. Processes with no alvará (pending, refused, withdrawn, prior information requests, comunicações prévias) are not in the medians.",
    "national": "Portugal, new construction for family housing: dwellings in licensed buildings (INE 0008309) and dwellings in completed buildings (INE 0013249), per calendar year, all promoters."
