  "licence_note": "Third-party data keep their own licences: CML's process data CC0, INE's counts INE's terms (free reuse with attribution). The medians and ratios estimador.pt computes from them are CC BY-NC 4.0.",
  "caveats": [
    "The medians cover only licences that were issued. A process still pending, refused or withdrawn has no alvará and is not counted, so the medians say nothing about how long those wait.",
    "The alvará comes after approval and after the applicant asks for it and pays the fees, so the time includes the applicant's own; Lisbon publishes no decision date.",
    "From 2024-03-04 (Simplex Urbanístico, DL 10/2024) many licences get proof of fee payment instead of an alvará; what Lisbon's alvará date records for them is not yet confirmed with the câmara.",
    "New builds are few: 15 to 66 alvarás a year, so one year's median moves a lot.",
    "2026 runs only to the last alvará in the snapshot (2026-10-29).",
    "Licences outrun completions every year in the national counts; the ratio of completions to licences two years before compares two counts, not the same dwellings.",
    "INE's completions for 2024 and 2025 are estimates."
  ],
